No sampled n=18 row here produces a strict pressure SCC.  That is a wall for disproof hunting but a useful proof hint: seek a combined endpoint private row plus pressure-leaf peeling certificate.

================================================================================================================
N=18 PROOF SHAPE AFTER THE WALLS
================================================================================================================
1. Local fan lemma.
   Owner-18 endpoints force units (1,5,7,11,13,17), half-gate 9,
   and one bridge variable.  The two bridges cover the same six
   residual gate endpoints.
2. Global bridge-charge lemma.
   Bridges 6 and 12 differ only after other owner rows are brought in.
   The owner-row delta table is the first finite target for a dual.
3. Product-packet lemma.
   The row-parent/gate/double-gate ladders are dyadic translates of
   one square-core packet, not independent obstructions.
4. Peeling lemma.
   Current n=18 pressure tournaments peel.  A counterexample must survive
   endpoint-private peeling and mobile pressure peeling simultaneously.

Concrete next formalization:
  Build a row-weight vector on owner rows 7,8,9,10,11,12,16 plus
  product-depth packet rows so that both bridge signs have positive
  cost unless a pressure SCC appears.  This would turn HYP-1942 and
  HYP-1950 into one certificate.
